                                "text": "garncarstwo artystyczne/ludowe",
                                "translation": "artistic/folk pottery",
                                "english": "artistic/folk pottery"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "13efa0de-f231-4be0-9824-66ee25ae830f",
                                "sense_id": "1cbf5239-d7eb-3f06-a961-305546901849",
                                "text": "zajmować się garncarstwem",
                                "translation": "to be occupied with pottery",
                                "english": "to be occupied with pottery"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a518e8f4-fe2b-4104-92d1-1537f47b516e",
                                "sense_id": "1cbf5239-d7eb-3f06-a961-305546901849",
                                "text": "Zachodzące w tym czasie przemiany w rozwoju tych społeczeństw, sposobach ich gospodarowania, różnych dziedzinach wytwórczości, takich jak garncarstwo, krzemieniarstwo, kamieniarstwo czy wierzeniach ilustrowane są zabytkami pochodzącymi z wykopalisk archeologicznych na terenie Śląska — mówi Mirosław Furmanek, komisarz wystawy.",
                                "translation": "The changes that took place at that time in the development of these societies, their farming methods, various areas of production, such as pottery, flint knapping, stonemasonry, and beliefs, are illustrated by artifacts from archaeological excavations in Silesia — says Mirosław Furmanek, the exhibition's commissioner.",
                                "english": "The changes that took place at that time in the development of these societies, their farming methods, various areas of production, such as pottery, flint knapping, stonemasonry, and beliefs, are illustrated by artifacts from archaeological excavations in Silesia — says Mirosław Furmanek, the exhibition's commissioner."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
